## 7. Spring Data JPA

Spring Data JPA simplifies database operations using JPA and ORM concepts.

Features:

* CRUD Operations
* Repository Interfaces
* Query Methods
* Pagination and Sorting
* Integration with Hibernate

Benefits:

* Less Database Code
